msgctxt "1768\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It's gonna be a big problem if the cops find me. Gotta\n"
"lay low for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1840\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Date-san knows where to hide. Gotta stick with him and\n"
"keep my eyes peeled for cops."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1925\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Did Kanda shoot Kashiwagi-san? I need to track him down\n"
"and get answers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1998\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya's here in Kamurocho. Sounds like he's hanging\n"
"around Nakamichi Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2076\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya's here in Kamurocho. Sounds like he's around\n"
"the west side of Taihei Boulevard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2163\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like I was wrong. Better search somewhere else.\n"
"Maybe in a Poppo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2235\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like I was wrong. Better search somewhere else.\n"
"Maybe in an M Store?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2310\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya must have gotten into something... Gotta hurry\n"
"to Children's Park."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2384\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One way or another, these Nishikiyama Family punks are\n"
"going to tell me where Kanda is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2472\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Kanda's in the Red Brick Hotel, room 403. Good thing\n"
"I'll have Rikiya with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2551\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Is he the one who killed Kashiwagi-san? Guess I'll\n"
"have to beat that info out of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2638\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Prologue"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2647\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Prologue Complete! Chapter 1: New Beginnings"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2693\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I should pay my respects at everyone's graves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2740\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I should talk to Sayama when I'm done. There's\n"
"something I have to tell her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2817\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I should say goodbye to Kazuki and Yuya before I leave\n"
"Kamurocho. First, Yuya. He should be at Stardust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2922\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Next up, Kazuki. I think he's still recovering over at\n"
"the Emoto Medical Clinic.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3005\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Time to teach these thugs to respect their elders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3056\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Back to Kazuki. He should be at the Emoto Medical\n"
"Clinic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3114\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Time to say goodbye to Kazuki and Emoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3155\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Time to say goodbye to Kazuki and Emoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3196\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Emoto will keep an eye on Haruka while I go talk to\n"
"Majima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3260\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I need to talk to Majima-san about the future of the\n"
"Tojo. Someone from his family must know where he is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3366\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to be screwing around fighting these\n"
"punks. Gotta shut them up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3448\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Sounds like Majima-san's at the Kazama Family office\n"
"over in the Millennium Tower. Time to move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3545\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like I'll find Majima-san on the roof of the\n"
"Millennium Tower. The elevator's the quickest way up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3650\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "There he is. Let's hope this goes well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3692\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I can't afford to lose this fight. The fate of Daigo\n"
"and the entire Tojo Clan hangs in the balance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3792\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 1 Complete! Chapter 2: The Ryudo Encounter"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3844\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Where could Izumi be? Haruka will check the orphanage\n"
"while I look for her outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3928\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"My neighbor saw Izumi heading towards the beach. I'll\n"
"see if she's around there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4009\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Why is the Ryudo Family trying to evict us? I'll head\n"
"downtown and find out where they are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4101\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Those guys were driving a light blue mini-truck.\n"
"Should be easy enough to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4181\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'll have to get through these guys if I want to meet\n"
"the head of the Ryudo Family. Here we go again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4283\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now I can go talk with the Ryudo Family. I'll tag\n"
"along with this Rikiya guy. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4362\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 2 Complete! Chapter 3: Power Struggle"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4409\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I took care of the eviction, but the Ryudo may have\n"
"something else up their sleeve. I'll be ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4508\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Shiro seems down about something. The best bet is to\n"
"ask him directly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4579\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Shiro wouldn't tell me anything, but something's wrong\n"
"all right. Maybe the other kids know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4672\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Sounds like Shiro is being bullied at school. Guess\n"
"I'll have to ask him directly to learn more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4769\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So he is being picked on... But why doesn't he want to\n"
"let the teachers know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4847\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Why won't Shiro tell the teachers he's being bullied?\n"
"Maybe Taichi knows..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4923\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The teacher's son is the one bullying Shiro!? I'd\n"
"better ask Shiro about this directly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5011\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now I know what's been bugging Shiro, but how can I\n"
"solve the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5082\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Maybe if I go to the golf course, I'll run into\n"
"Akasaka. I'll head downtown and take the monorail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5181\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Maybe if I go to the golf course, I'll run into\n"
"Akasaka. I should take the monorail to the course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5280\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Apparently, Akasaka frequents this golf course.\n"
"Hopefully I can find him here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5361\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm glad Akasaka seems willing to help the orphanage.\n"
"I'm sure Shiro will be happy to hear it, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5461\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Everyone's back from school. Time to get dinner ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5516\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Taichi and Ayako are arguing. I should go see what\n"
"it's about. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5580\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Somebody stole Ayako's money!? Time to hold a house\n"
"meeting. I'll gather everyone in the dining room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5682\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"All the kids are waiting for me in the dining room.\n"
"Time to get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5769\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I had hoped someone would own up, but no luck. Still,\n"
"whoever did it can't hide it forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5861\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The money's back in Ayako's wallet? What's going on?\n"
"I need to get the full story from Eri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5953\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Ayako got her money back, so that takes care of that.\n"
"Now how do I explain this to everyone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6046\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Now that that's settled, it's time for dinner. Let's\n"
"see what Haruka feels like eating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6134\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The Ryudo Family are here. I should go outside and see\n"
"what's up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6200\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So Nakahara's flying off the handle. Not exactly my\n"
"problem, but I'll drop by the Ryudo office anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6303\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Saki's missing, so I'd better find out what happened\n"
"to her. I'll go search Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6391\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Saki was seen in a Hatsumachi convenience store with\n"
"someone who may be her mother. I'll ask there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6491\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like the Tamashiro thugs know something about\n"
"Saki... and I'm going to find out what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6589\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like Saki and her mom are being held by the\n"
"Tamashiro Family. I'll head to their hideout. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6686\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I found Saki's sketchbook. Now that I know Tamashiro\n"
"has her for sure, I'll bust in and take her back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6789\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Saki is in here somewhere... I have to get her back.\n"
"Both for her sake, and for Nakahara's."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6881\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I can't let these scumbags have Saki. Time to clean\n"
"house. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6941\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 3, Complete! Chapter 4: The Man in the Sketch"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6996\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm going to Kamurocho tomorrow. I should head home\n"
"and get to sleep when I'm ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7081\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'll go look for that puppy downtown. Mikio and Izumi\n"
"are on Ryukyu Boulevard, so I'll try Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7184\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I'd better chase this dog down before I lose him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7234\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Great... I have to bring Izumi some dog food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7280\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Great... I have to bring Izumi a hamburger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7324\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Great... I have to bring Izumi some milk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7366\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Great... I have to bring Izumi a bone. I don't even\n"
"know where to get one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7441\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Figures nobody would be selling just a bone. Guess\n"
"I'll give up and go back to Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7527\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Great... I have to bring Izumi a bone. I don't even\n"
"know where to get one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7602\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Figures nobody would be selling just a bone. Guess\n"
"I'll give up and go back to Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7688\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So now I have to find this dog a ball? I'm pretty sure\n"
"Koji has one back at the orphanage..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7781\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So now I have to find this dog a foxtail? The beach\n"
"near Morning Glory might be a good place to check..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7886\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So now I have to find this dog a stuffed animal?\n"
"I think the kids have some in their room at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7985\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Got the rubber ball. Now back to Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8025\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I guess this toy is close enough. Now back to Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8078\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"All right, I borrowed the teddy bear that was on the\n"
"shelf. Now back to Izumi. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8158\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Izumi doesn't want to give up... Maybe a little walk\n"
"around town will help give me some ideas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8253\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I wonder if Izumi and Mikio are still with that that\n"
"dog... I'd better go back and see what's up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8351\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like the dog finally took a liking to Izumi.\n"
"Time to head home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8421\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I need to make Mitsuo look cool. There must be a good\n"
"shop downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8490\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I found just the right thing for Mitsuo. Now to head\n"
"home and show Rikiya up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8568\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Riona turned Mitsuo down? I wonder why..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8610\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Wow, Riona's learned how to make duruwakashi\n"
"all by herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8671\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Mitsuo went to see a movie by himself? Sounds like\n"
"he was pretty let down. I should go after him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8769\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I was worried about how things would turn out, but\n"
"it looks like Riona understands Mitsuo's feelings. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8872\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"There's still time before I leave. Maybe I'll play\n"
"baseball with Koji and the others on the beach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8971\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Let's knock 'em out of the park for Akira... 20\n"
"balls should do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9039\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It's about time for me to take off for Tokyo. I\n"
"can get the rest of what I need downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9129\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like Koji made a new friend.\n"
"Well, time to head to Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9193\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Before I head to Kamurocho, I should go shopping\n"
"with Haruka. I'll go to the market downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9287\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Haruka's not finished shopping yet. I've got\n"
"nothing to do, so I might as well look around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9379\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"We're done shopping, and I have to get to the\n"
"airport. We should head to the monorail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9466\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Time to leave for Tokyo. I'd better finish\n"
"getting prepared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9527\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Revelations...? Maybe I can learn something from\n"
"that woman there waiting for the signal. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9618\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seems there's some kind of ruckus at Stardust.\n"
"I'll check it out, then go see Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9711\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like the Nishikiyama Family are picking a fight\n"
"with the Kazama Family. Gotta beat Hasebe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9808\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 4 Complete! Chapter 5: The Curtain Rises"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9858\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Police are staked out all around Millennium\n"
"Tower. I should try to sneak in from Pink St."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9948\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I got jumped by a bunch of foreigners. They\n"
"don't seem interested in talking it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10033\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I should get to the Kazama Family office at the top\n"
"of Millennium Tower to meet with Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10133\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This guy in black must have some connection with\n"
"those foreigners. I'll chase him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10221\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've got to see Kashiwagi-san, so I'll head to the\n"
"Kazama office in the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10311\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 5 Complete! Chapter 6: Gameplan"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10352\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm not up for being interrogated. Better hide\n"
"out someplace inconspicuous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10428\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Date-san really saved me. I can trust him, so\n"
"I'll follow his lead. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10497\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I gotta find Kanda, one of the Tojo Clan execs.\n"
"He may have attacked Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10581\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya's supposed to be here in Kamurocho. I\n"
"should wait for him to let me know where he is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10674\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya may be on Nakamichi Street.\n"
"I should head over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10735\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya may be on Taihei Boulevard. I should head\n"
"over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10796\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like I was wrong... I'll try to find him with\n"
"this new email."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10864\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya must have gotten into something...\n"
"Gotta hurry to Children's Park."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10938\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty lucky running into the Nishiki goons\n"
"like this. I'll beat Kanda's location out of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11037\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Kanda should be in room 403 of the Red Brick\n"
"Hotel. Rikiya's got my back covered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11119\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Kanda ran off, but I won't let him get away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11164\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Is he the one who killed Kashiwagi-san? I'll give\n"
"him a beat-down and find out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11244\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I might as well show Rikiya around Kamurocho.\n"
"Let's go get some yakiniku first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11324\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I might as well show Rikiya around Kamurocho.\n"
"Let's check out Don Quijote next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11404\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya wants to store his bags. Let's go to the\n"
"coin lockers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11466\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Let's take a breather in Public Park 3."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11506\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Let's head to Asia, the bikini bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11542\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'm going back to Serena so I can fill Date-san in\n"
"on everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11608\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"When I'm ready, I could go tell Date-san what's up,\n"
"or I could hang out with Rikiya some more. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11704\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 6 Complete! Chapter 7: The Mad Dog"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11748\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I need to get the facts from Majima-san. He should\n"
"be in Purgatory, through the public restroom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11845\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "I should follow Majima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11873\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Heh, same old Majima-san... If I want to know the\n"
"truth, guess I'll have to beat him again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11965\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 7 Complete! Chapter 8: Conspirators"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12010\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya's been attacked by the Snake Flower\n"
"Triad! I've got to go help him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12085\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Lau Ka Long should be waiting on the roof.\n"
"I can't waste any time in saving Rikiya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12169\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 8 Complete! Chapter 9: The Plot"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12210\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya should go back to Okinawa. I'll see him off\n"
"to the taxi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12274\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rikiya left for Okinawa. I wonder if Date-san has\n"
"any leads?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12335\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Time to meet with Tamiya at the National Diet\n"
"Building. I need to go see Date-san at Serena first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12434\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Time to meet with Tamiya. There should be someone\n"
"waiting for me in front of Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12529\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"If these guys catch me, I'll disappoint Tamiya.\n"
"I've got to get past them somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12612\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 9 Complete! Chapter 10: Unfinished Business"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12665\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I gotta keep my promise to Tamiya and help Toma\n"
"in Okinawa. First, I'll get a cab to the airport."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12763\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I need to save Toma from the CIA, but first things\n"
"first. I should go back and check on the kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12861\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like Toma's going to be in the city office\n"
"all day. I'll spend the day with the kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12953\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like Taichi hasn't gone shopping like he's\n"
"supposed to. I better go set things straight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13048\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I told Taichi to go to the store, but I wonder if\n"
"he'll go. I'd better check on him later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13139\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Taichi passed out!? I've got to hurry to the\n"
"beach!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13191\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I don't see Taichi around the beach anywhere.\n"
"Did he go back to the orphanage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13270\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Taichi passed out. I hope it's not anything\n"
"serious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13325\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I had no idea Taichi had a health problem like\n"
"that... Maybe we can cheer him up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13409\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A wrestling match for Taichi sounds great. I'll\n"
"hang around in town until I hear from Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13503\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Looks like everything's ready for the wrestling\n"
"match. I'll meet everyone at the beach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13591\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This wrestling is sure to cheer Taichi up. Let's\n"
"put on a real show to excite all the kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13683\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"So Taichi's allergic to buckwheat. I'll make\n"
"sure to be careful when I prepare meals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13769\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Haruka went shopping, but something seems wrong.\n"
"I should follow her and see what's up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13857\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I knew there was something going on... What's she\n"
"going to Hatsumachi for? I should follow her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13953\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"What's going on between Haruka and those men?\n"
"I'll follow her to the monorail station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14040\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Haruka's hiding something... but she won't tell\n"
"me now. I should head back to the orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14133\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Where could Haruka be going at this time of night?\n"
"I should follow her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14205\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Something seems dirty about this... I've got to\n"
"follow Haruka and find out what the deal is. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14299\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I was hoping to get the truth from Haruka, but\n"
"I'd better shake him for now to avoid trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14393\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Haruka ran off. I've got to take care of these\n"
"guys before I do anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14472\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These sleazebags think they can use a kid to make\n"
"their dirty money? I'll teach them otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14568\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"It's gotten really late. We should go back to the\n"
"orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14629\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I wonder if the kids finished their homework.\n"
"I should ask if they took their baths or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14721\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Ayako really tries her best to take care of\n"
"everyone, but maybe she's trying a bit too hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14814\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Ayako ran out of the orphanage.\n"
"I have to find her and bring her back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14885\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've got to catch up to Ayako. If I'm not\n"
"careful, I'll lose sight of her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14960\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've got to catch up to Ayako. If I'm not\n"
"careful, I'll lose sight of her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15035\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've got to catch up to Ayako. If I'm not\n"
"careful, I'll lose sight of her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15110\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Ayako finally calmed down.\n"
"Let's go on back to the orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15172\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I have to protect Toma from the CIA. He should\n"
"be at a pole-dancing bar in Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15259\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I've made up my mind to save Toma and this man.\n"
"But the only way to do that is to defeat him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15353\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Chapter 10 Complete! Chapter 11: Crisis"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15394\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Morning Glory was attacked!? I've got to get back\n"
"there now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15455\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Nakahara's being held captive at a bullring on the\n"
"edge of town! A cab downtown will get me there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15554\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I'll take care of these guys before the cops get\n"
"here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15609\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Chapter 11 Complete! Final Chapter: The End of\n"
"Ambition"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15666\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"My last time walking with Haruka in Kamurocho...\n"
"When I'm ready, I'll bid her farewell at Serena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15764\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I have to go to Daigo at Touto Hospital.\n"
"I'll save him, then settle the score with Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15853\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"These punks must be from the Hakuho Clan.\n"
"I'll beat Daigo's location out of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15935\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The captain of the Hakuho Clan should know\n"
"where Daigo is. I'll grab him and make him talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16027\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Daigo's on the 25th floor of this building.\n"
"I have to hurry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16088\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"I made it to the 25th floor. Daigo should be\n"
"here somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16149\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This guy again. He must have something to do with\n"
"Mine. I've got to beat him to make it to the roof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16250\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Daigo's on the roof of the building. I've got no\n"
"time to waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16314\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The last battle... I gotta keep my promise to\n"
"Rikiya and defeat Mine. Only I can stop him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16406\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You beat Yakuza 3! Congratulations!"
msgstr "Hai completato Yakuza 4! Congratulazioni!"
